<title>USA: Darden Restaurants Q2 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Darden Restaurants Q2 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr    loss     $0.07	   profit $0.10</p>
<p> Net    loss     11,200	  profit 16,300</p>
<p> Sales	     748,800		  731,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  157,500		  158,900</p>
<p>	  Six MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    profit   $0.06	   profit $0.03</p>
<p> Net    profit   9,300	   profit 4,300</p>
<p> Sales	     1,544,300		1,567,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  157,600		  158,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Darden Restaurants Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The first quarter 1996 includes a $44.8 million after tax restructuring charge of $0.28 per share to close all China Coast restaurants.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
